{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p053f","title":"袁逢袁隗均任三公","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p053f-account","label":"华峤《汉书》","text":"袁成弟逢及逢弟隗均为三公。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p053f-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dongyuan-p0037","role":"任官","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p053f-q"]},{"person":"dongyuan-p0026","role":"任官","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p053f-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文未明示时间","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p053f-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-p053f-q","source_order":[6,213,"P053f"],"order":1619},{"id":"lvzang-e-o131","title":"旻对袁逢口陈手画西域诸国转拜长水校尉终太原太守","accounts":[{"id":"lvzang-a-34bb1ef01bbd3b365ecf","label":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","text":"旻对袁逢口陈手画西域诸国转拜长水校尉终太原太守","evidence":["lvzang-q-10f0a8a1ede4398098fe"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0005","role":"还京师见太尉袁逢、具答言西域本三十六国后分为五十五稍散至百余国其国大小道里近远人数多少风俗燥湿山川草木鸟兽异物名种不与中国同者悉口陈其状手画地形、转拜长水校尉终太原太守","evidence":["lvzang-q-10f0a8a1ede4398098fe"]},{"person":"dongyuan-p0037","role":"太尉、问其西域诸国土地风俗人物种数、奇其才叹息言虽班固作西域传何以加此","evidence":["lvzang-q-10f0a8a1ede4398098fe"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lvzang-q-10f0a8a1ede4398098fe"]},"ordering_evidence":"lvzang-q-10f0a8a1ede4398098fe","source_order":[7,163,99],"order":1876}],"persons":[{"id":"dongyuan-p0037","name":"袁逢","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o069","dongyuan-q-b-0f538afc5a3263f0afc7","lvzang-q-10f0a8a1ede4398098fe"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"dongyuan-m-o069-dongyuan-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o069","dongyuan-q-b-0f538afc5a3263f0afc7"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p053-dongyuan-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p053"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p054-dongyuan-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p054"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p057-dongyuan-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p057"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p053f-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9e9f888b25d6ea1dc29c","layer":"pei","quote":"成弟逢，逢弟隗：皆为公。","attribution":"华峤《汉书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":107,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-b-0f538afc5a3263f0afc7","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-0f538afc5a3263f0afc7","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗逢：即袁逢。字周阳。袁隗的哥哥。官至司空，谥宣文侯。传附《后汉书》卷四十五《袁安传》。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":392,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7b9b6abf94ffde14db98","start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o069","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-0666ed4730e1f87561a7","layer":"original","quote":"袁术字公路。司空逢子〖1〗，绍之从弟也〖2〗。以侠气闻，举孝廉，除郎中。历职内外〖3〗。后为折冲校尉、虎贲中郎将〖4〗。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":388,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p053","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9e9f888b25d6ea1dc29c","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞华峤《汉书》曰：“安字邵公。好学有威重。明帝时为楚郡太守，治楚王狱。所申理者四百余家，皆蒙全济，安遂为名臣。章帝时至司徒，生蜀郡太守京。京弟敞，为司空。京子汤，太尉。汤四子：长子平；平弟成，左中郎将：并早卒。成弟逢，逢弟隗：皆为公。”","attribution":"华峤《汉书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p054","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-4721c54c5b6ec0b6f42b","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》曰：“自安以下，皆博爱容众，无所拣择。宾客入其门，无贤愚皆得所欲，为天下所归。绍即逢之庶子，术异母兄也；出后成，为子。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p057","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-b177a81f69d16840f994","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：《魏书》云“绍，逢之庶子，出后伯父成”。如此《记》所言，则似实成所生。夫人追服所生，礼无其文；况于所后，而可以行之？二书未详孰是。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf0d3b8b250635b85059","start":0,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-10f0a8a1ede4398098fe","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e2f3b3d6a80ec490e88c","layer":"pei","quote":"还京师，见太尉袁逢。逢问其西域诸国土地、风俗、人物、种数。旻具答言：西域本三十六国，后分为五十五，稍散至百余国。其国大小，道里近远，人数多少，风俗燥湿，山川、草木、鸟兽、异物名种，不与中国同者，悉口陈其状，手画地形。逢奇其才，叹息言：‘虽班固作《西域传》，何以加此？’旻转拜长水校尉，终太原太守","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3473eb9b61408b668d54","start":99,"end":246,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
